<title>UK: WestHyp sets 200 mln mark four-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>WestHyp sets 200 mln mark four-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFAELISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0 PCT  MATURITY    29.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOUR YEAR ONE, 4.50 PCT YEAR TWO, 5.25 PCT YEAR</p>
<p>		 THREE AND 5.75 PCT YEAR FOUR</p>
<p> LISTING    DDF	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL AT PAR 29.JAN.98</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
